name: sim.loadModule
description: 
luaSynopsis: int pluginHandle=sim.loadModule(string filenameAndPath,string pluginName)
pythonSynopsis: int pluginHandle=sim.loadModule(string filenameAndPath,string pluginName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. filenameAndPath: file name and path of the plugin
2. pluginName: name of the plugin. If the file name is simExtXXX.dll, then the name should be XXX
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. handle of the plugin if value is 0 or positive. otherwise:
2. -3: plugin could not be loaded
3. -2: plugin is missing entry points
4. -1: plugin could not initialize
